</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Derive the derivative of <m>\arcsin x</m> by implicit differentiation.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Derive the derivative of <m>\arctan x</m>.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Derive the derivative formula for an inverse function.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Derive the derivative of <m>x^x</m> using logarithmic differentiation.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Prove the multivariable chain rule in Jacobian notation.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Derive Jacobi's formula for the derivative of a determinant.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
